based frequency hopping is supported to achieve a high
robustness against interference and other channel impairments.TSCH also supports various network topologies, including
star, tree, and mesh. TSCH mode exhibits many similarities
to WirelessHART and ISA-100.11a, including slotted access,multichannel communication, and frequency hopping for mesh
networks. In fact, it deﬁnes more details of the MAC operation
with respect to WirelessHART and ISA-100.11a. However, theTSCH standard does not specify how to derive an appropriate
