system variables, possibly enforced by the required control
system performance. In the joint design approach, the wireless
network and control system parameters are jointly optimizedconsidering their interaction through the critical system vari-
ables. Fig. 8illustrates the section structure related to previous
Sections VandVI. In Table II, we summarize the character-
istics of the related works. In the table, we have demonstrated
whether indications of requirements and communication and
